    <string name="data_storage_intro">I-Retro Player igcina izicwangciso ze-app kwidathabheyisi encinci yasekuhlaleni. Umculo wakho kunye noluhlu lwakho lokudlala zihlala zizifayile eziqhelekileyo kwiifolda ozikhethayo.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_title">Idatabase yesicelo</string>
    <string name="data_storage_app_data_body">Ifayile: %1$s\nIndlela: %2$s\n\nUgcino lweelayibrari, imbonakalo yokukhangela, ukuqhubekeka kokudlala, i-equalizer, umxholo, kunye neenketho zolwimi.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_title">Iifayile zomculo</string>
    <string name="data_storage_library_body">Iifayile zesandi azikhe zikopishwe kwidathabheyisi ye-app. Yongeza iifolda zethala lweencwadi kwaye iRetro Player ifunda iifayile ngqo kwidiski.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_title">Iifayile zoluhlu lweengoma</string>
    <string name="data_storage_playlists_body">Ii-playlist zii-fayile ezilula ze-.m3u ezigcinwe ngaphakathi kwiifolda zakho zethala. Ungazihlela kwi-app okanye ngaso nasiphi na isihleli sombhalo.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_title">Iqonga: %1$s</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_permissions_title">Iimvume ze-Android kunye nogcino</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_native_body">I-Retro Player igcina i-database yayo kwindawo yenkxaso yabucala ye-app kugcino lwangaphakathi. Iifayile zakho zomculo zihlala kwiifolda ozikhethayo ngesikhethi seefolda sesistim.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_title">Ukudlalwa kwangasemva kwe-Android</string>
    <string name="data_storage_android_playback_body">Xa umculo udlala, i-Retro Player isebenzisa inkonzo yemidiya esembindini ukuze ukudlala kuqhubeke naxa uvalela ifowuni okanye utshintsha ii-apps, kunye nezilawuli zokudlala kwisaziso senkqubo. Ukutswayipa i-app ude iphume kwi-Recents kuyayinqanda imidlalo kwaye kususwe nesaziso.</string>
    <string name="data_storage_platform_body_android">Idatha ye-app igcinwa kwindawo yenkxaso yabucala ye-app kugcino lwangaphakathi.</string>
